      "id": "fcs.t02",
      "statements": {
        "f1": "The Policy issuance service currently publishes completed-issuance events to fcs-issue-marsh. Consumers use those events to start document generation.",
        "f2": "On 2026-02-19, the Policy issuance service changed its event queue to fcs-issue-thistle to separate issuance traffic from renewal backfills."
      },
      "query": "Which event queue does the Policy issuance service currently use?"
    },
