      "id": "fcs.t03",
      "statements": {
        "f1": "The Actuarial nightly batch currently starts at 01:17 UTC. Its input snapshot is closed before the job begins.",
        "f2": "On 2026-04-08, the Actuarial nightly batch moved its scheduled start time to 04:09 UTC so late-arriving policy adjustments reach the input snapshot."
      },
      "query": "What is the current scheduled start time for the Actuarial nightly batch?"
    },
    {
      "id": "fcs.t04",
      "statements": {
        "f1": "Repair payout exports currently land in destination bucket fcs-payout-basalt. The export manifest is written after all payout rows have been uploaded.",
        "f2": "On 2026-05-14, Repair payout exports switched their destination bucket to fcs-payout-amber to isolate settlement files from older export batches."
      },
      "query": "What is the current destination bucket for Repair payout exports?"
    },
    {
      "id": "fcs.t05",
      "statements": {
        "f1": "The Fraud scoring gateway currently loads ruleset version fcs-fraud-r10.2.8. It records the loaded version alongside each scoring decision.",
        "f2": "On 2026-06-03, the Fraud scoring gateway changed its ruleset version to fcs-fraud-r8.1.6 after the previous release produced excessive referrals."
      },
      "query": "Which ruleset version does the Fraud scoring gateway currently use?"
    },
