      "id": "fcs.t06",
      "statements": {
        "f1": "The Claims evidence archive currently retains evidence for 547 days. The expiry job calculates removal dates from the archive timestamp.",
        "f2": "On 2026-01-27, the Claims evidence archive changed its retention period to 127 days after the evidence schedule was narrowed for this archive."
      },
      "query": "What is the current retention period for the Claims evidence archive?"
