        "f1": "The OCR review console currently uses fcs-review-heron as its operations dashboard. Review leads check it for queue age and exception counts.",
        "f2": "On 2026-08-05, the OCR review console moved its operations dashboard to fcs-review-birch so reviewers could see queue age beside exception counts."
