      "id": "fcs.t09",
      "statements": {
        "f1": "The Claims intake router is currently deployed in fcs-vale-south-3. Its health checks cover both document and metadata routing.",
        "f2": "On 2026-03-30, the Claims intake router changed its deployment region to fcs-vale-east-2 to reduce latency for incoming document traffic."
