      "id": "fcs.t10",
      "statements": {
        "f1": "The Fraud alert publisher currently sends notifications to fcs-alert-brook. Alerts include a case reference but no evidence attachments.",
        "f2": "On 2026-09-11, the Fraud alert publisher changed its notification channel to fcs-alert-grove so alerts would reach the staffed triage queue."
